[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3029184201","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104722#issuecomment-3029184201","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104722","id":3029184201,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60ja7J","user":{"login":"Gurkgamer","id":6461032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NjEwMzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6461032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gurkgamer","html_url":"https://github.com/Gurkgamer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gurkgamer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gurkgamer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gurkgamer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gurkgamer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gurkgamer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gurkgamer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gurkgamer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gurkgamer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gurkgamer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-02T20:11:10Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T20:11:10Z","body":"Hello, I don't know if is here where I should write about this, as it may change a little bit my original report.\n\nI tried the 4.5 beta 2 build just to check if anything had changed with the scroll behavior in RichTextLabel, and I just found out that the \"Before Shaping\" behavior has changed and now it does not follow the text and scroll the same way it did in 4.4.1. Instead, now behaves like the \"After shaping\" option.\n\nI couldn't find anything about changes in the RichTextLabel that may have touched the scrolling, but I'm not that knowledgeable to be sure.\n\nHere are two screenshots with the difference.\n\n4.4.1\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/99745c4a-6acd-4a67-b411-28982171ad36)\n\n4.5 beta 2\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d4c907b7-a153-4223-86d4-a43a723d93f8)\n\nI'm not sure if this is something I should report, and if so, where. Just in case, I would like to apologize too if this message is actually irrelevant.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3029184201/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3046094350","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104722#issuecomment-3046094350","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104722","id":3046094350,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61j7YO","user":{"login":"stolerz","id":30323054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzIzMDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30323054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stolerz","html_url":"https://github.com/stolerz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stolerz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stolerz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stolerz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stolerz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stolerz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stolerz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stolerz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stolerz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stolerz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-07T18:04:23Z","updated_at":"2025-07-07T18:04:23Z","body":"I'm also having the originally described issue in GODOT 4.4.1 ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3046094350/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3046343147","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104722#issuecomment-3046343147","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104722","id":3046343147,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61k4Hr","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-07T19:47:55Z","updated_at":"2025-07-07T20:00:45Z","body":"> If [code]true[/code], the window scrolls down to display new content automatically.\n\nScroll following is intended to be used when text is added to the RTL, so it is expected to have no effect when visible character are changed.\n\nBut I guess it would make sense to add a separate flag for following visible characters.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3046343147/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3050202147","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104722#issuecomment-3050202147","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104722","id":3050202147,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61zmQj","user":{"login":"Gurkgamer","id":6461032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NjEwMzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6461032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gurkgamer","html_url":"https://github.com/Gurkgamer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gurkgamer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gurkgamer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gurkgamer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gurkgamer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gurkgamer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gurkgamer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gurkgamer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gurkgamer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gurkgamer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-08T20:21:57Z","updated_at":"2025-07-08T20:21:57Z","body":"Hello, I've tried the change and it works for the after shaping option, but I think it added estrange unexpected new behaviors. \n\nNow the \"Before Shaping\" option does wrap the sentence too like the \"After Shaping\", the next word jumps to the next line if it doesn't fit.\n\nAlso, I noticed that if I hide the scroll, disabling the \"Scroll active\" option, the scroll does appear and it covers the whole rich text.\n\nPlease take a look at the attached image. This was done with the MRP at this thread.\n\n- The first two Rich Text label, have the \"Scroll Active\" disabled. The third one, enabled. Neither of them has the \"Scroll following\" option, but do have the new \"Scroll Following Visible Characters\".\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5e6b05a1-8bb5-48a9-9323-ff6bad87b2f7)\n\nI've noticed also that the first visible sentence doesn't appear aligned in the middle vertically, it already starts like there are going to be two sentences (I think this only worked for the \"Before Shaping\" case).\n\nFinally, there seems to be short moments that the label shows a panel before disappearing or showing again, I think I can explain better using the project where I found this, is more visible.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/53355433-8a92-40cb-a1ff-ba7b55d1d494)\n\nIf I have overstepped with these tests, please let me know, I just wanted to give some feedback and I'm not sure if this is welcome or appropriate.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3050202147/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3050219459","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104722#issuecomment-3050219459","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104722","id":3050219459,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61zqfD","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starre